 "_comment": "Everything the desk is allowed to touch, and nothing else. An advisor cannot trade what is not in this list, because risk.py checks membership before anything reaches a book. Each instrument names the providers that can quote it, in the order they should be asked; 'invert' means the provider publishes the pair the other way up. Prices are in USD. 2026-09-04: every remaining provider was probed live for the first time and stooq was removed after answering 404 on every symbol; the surviving symbols have been confirmed against a live response for yahoo, frankfurter and erapi — a symbol that is wrong shows up as an instrument with no price and a named reason in company/data/prices/<date>.json, which is the point of recording why each link failed. 2026-09-10: eight bond and property funds added (SHY IEF TIP LQD HYG EMB VNQI REM), symbols and dividend events verified live on Yahoo; TLT reclassed bond, VNQ property. `rates` lists quotes that are read by the ledger and never traded.",
